{"item_uid": "指考95-history-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "史家不離事而言理，客觀精神乃是歷史寫作的第一守則。在描寫一個歷史事件時，下列哪一項\n最不易受到史家主觀因素的影響？", "options": {"A": "事件發生的時地", "B": "事件的前因後果", "C": "事件的歷史意義", "D": "事件的是非評價"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 90.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 98.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 76.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 90.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 76.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 98.0, 95.0, 90.0, 68.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "二十世紀時，中國發生過兩次澎湃的青年運動：1919年的「五四運動」與1989年的「六四民運」。\n兩個運動發生的歷史背景有異，卻抱持某些相同的目標。這些相同的目標主要是什麼？", "options": {"A": "啟蒙與救亡", "B": "自由與民主", "C": "富國與強兵", "D": "德先生與賽先生"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 16.0, "B": 72.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 11.0, "B": 84.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 19.0, "B": 62.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 72.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 62.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [87.0, 78.0, 71.0, 65.0, 61.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "歷史家比較十八世紀以後東、西方各自擁有的優勢，指出：「歐洲人發源自小城邦與民族國家，\n對令人昏眩的數量特別敏感。對他們來說，亞洲代表的就是數字驚人，歐洲只能以優勢的技術\n與之對抗。」文中所說「令人昏眩的數量」、「數字驚人」，最可能是指下列何者？", "options": {"A": "廣袤的土地", "B": "眾多的人口", "C": "龐大的軍隊", "D": "豐富的物產"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 71.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 77.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 64.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 71.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 64.0, "discrimination": 13.0, "p_quintiles": [79.0, 74.0, 71.0, 67.0, 62.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "1624年到1661年間，荷蘭聯合東印度公司佔有臺灣，以之為基地進行東亞貿易。當時，臺灣哪\n一種出口商品最具國際競爭力和知名度？", "options": {"A": "蔗糖", "B": "樟腦", "C": "稻米", "D": "茶葉"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 46.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 25.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 65.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 29.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 36.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 46.0, "p_high": 65.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [71.0, 54.0, 43.0, 34.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "某個時期，一些飽受異族壓制的國家，出現饒富民族風味的音樂。作曲家刻意擷取民歌素材，\n讓世代相傳的歌謠、舞曲與宗教樂曲，滲入各種音樂形式，藉之發抒對國家自由的企望，建立\n國民對傳統的自信與驕傲。這種音樂風格最主要盛行於下列何處？", "options": {"A": "文藝復興時期的義大利北部", "B": "拿破崙佔領下的日耳曼地區", "C": "奧匈帝國統治時的東歐地區", "D": "蘇聯極權控制下的鐵幕國家"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 18.0, "B": 39.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 49.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 32.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 15.0, "p_value": 23.0, "p_high": 33.0, "p_low": 14.0, "discrimination": 19.0, "p_quintiles": [36.0, 26.0, 21.0, 17.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "某生向圖書館借閱《利瑪竇中國札記》、《蘇州府志》、《唐伯虎集》三種書籍，計畫寫一篇小論\n文。下列何者最可能是這篇論文的主題？", "options": {"A": "〈唐代蘇州的風俗〉", "B": "〈元代的海外貿易〉", "C": "〈明清江南的文人生活〉", "D": "〈晚清西學的輸入〉"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 76.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 92.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 16.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 56.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 76.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 56.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 88.0, 81.0, 71.0, 47.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "一本教科書描述某地區的宗教生活：「在這個地區，它一直是居於主流地位的宗教，現在仍是\n大多數人的虔誠信仰。過去，年輕男人幾乎都按慣例，到寺院度過兩年時光，現在這樣做的人\n也很多。他們要剃光頭、披黃色袈裟、捧討飯缽。成年以後，他們也要為正道做出許多犧牲。」\n這個地區盛行的應是下列哪一種信仰？", "options": {"A": "藏傳佛教", "B": "婆羅門教", "C": "大乘佛教", "D": "小乘佛教"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 34.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 31.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 33.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 48.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 32.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 17.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 31.0, "p_high": 48.0, "p_low": 17.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [54.0, 37.0, 28.0, 22.0, 15.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "在追求現代化的過程中，傳統中國的許多特質已不復見於現代中國，但有些傳統特質則仍舊保\n留下來。下列哪項特徵，在傳統與現代中國都看得到？", "options": {"A": "以農業為國家經濟發展的終極目標", "B": "統治者強調平等，反對有階級差異", "C": "以天朝對待藩屬的體制與各國交往", "D": "在統治方式中特別強調文化的力量\n- 1 -\n95年指考 第 2 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 83.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 95.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 67.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 83.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 67.0, "discrimination": 28.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 93.0, 88.0, 80.0, 59.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "右邊是一幅古代希臘世界地圖，圖中哪一個地區是《荷馬\n史詩》故事發生地與希臘科學思想萌芽的地方？ 丙", "options": {"A": "甲 丁", "B": "乙 乙", "C": "丙\n甲", "D": "丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 35.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 17.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 34.0, "p_value": 14.0, "p_high": 17.0, "p_low": 13.0, "discrimination": 4.0, "p_quintiles": [20.0, 12.0, 11.0, 12.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "某殖民國家在殖民地舉行「眾神昇天」活動：在活動中先行祭拜殖民地原有宗教的神祇，請祂\n們回到天上，然後將理論上已不具神性的神像移走，再以殖民國本身的宗教取代之。這最可能\n是以下哪一種情況？", "options": {"A": "日本人在台灣以神道教取代民間的宗教", "B": "阿拉伯人在北非以回教取代非洲的宗教", "C": "英國人在印度以英國的國教取代印度教", "D": "西班牙人在南美以天主教取代馬雅宗教"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 36.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 27.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 50.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 27.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 25.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 24.0}, "omit_rate": 15.0, "p_value": 36.0, "p_high": 50.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 25.0, "p_quintiles": [55.0, 40.0, 33.0, 27.0, 23.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "歐洲歷史上有一時期，文人雖然學識淵博，卻只能在巨室富家中擔任教師，或在王公貴族處擔\n任幕僚，無法靠寫書維生。不過，他們為求發抒己見，仍勤於著述。這最可能出自下列何種知\n識環境？", "options": {"A": "十二世紀教會壓制異端，箝制思想，控制出版", "B": "十六世紀閱讀大眾尚未形成，文人難以此為生", "C": "十八世紀王權高漲，壓抑異議人士，文人噤聲", "D": "二十世紀極權主義興起，新聞出版業受到壓制"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 42.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 41.0, "B": 37.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 38.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 23.0, "p_high": 37.0, "p_low": 13.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [43.0, 26.0, 19.0, 15.0, 12.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "二十世紀初期，歐洲發生這樣的文化變遷：「巴黎、柏林或倫敦的嗜好和說話腔調，傳佈到國\n內最遙遠的鄉村。根深蒂固的地方文化開始被全國性文化取代，各國生活方式也愈來愈受到國\n際消費文化的影響。」下列何者是促成這種變化的主要媒介？", "options": {"A": "報紙和廣播", "B": "鐵路與飛機", "C": "電視和電影", "D": "網路與漫畫"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 56.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 71.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 41.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 49.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 56.0, "p_high": 71.0, "p_low": 41.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [75.0, 63.0, 55.0, 47.0, 38.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "日治初期，官方曾經統計臺灣三個族群之女性纏足人數和比例，如下表：\n族群別 纏足人數 纏足比例\n甲 797347 68.0%\n乙 2881 1.5%\n丙 224 50.2%\n根據此表的數據，下列分析何者最為合理？", "options": {"A": "乙為原住民，因其人口不多，故纏足人數比較少", "B": "丙為日本人，因來臺時間短，故纏足人數也較少", "C": "乙為粵人，因女性參與勞動者多，纏足比例較低", "D": "丙為閩人，其男女地位不平等，故纏足者比例高"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 48.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 8.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 66.0, "D": 11.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 31.0}, "omit_rate": 16.0, "p_value": 48.0, "p_high": 66.0, "p_low": 31.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [72.0, 55.0, 46.0, 38.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "皇帝和大臣討論如何選拔人才。大臣主張：應該只問他們個人能力的高低，不要計較他們的家\n世背景。皇帝反對大臣的說法，強調歷時久長的世家才是培養人才的沃土，所以是選拔優秀人\n才的重要標準。這件事最可能發生在哪個時期？", "options": {"A": "秦、漢", "B": "南北朝", "C": "宋、元", "D": "明、清"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 75.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 95.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 47.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 47.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 92.0, 84.0, 68.0, 35.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "「敵方坦克與大炮已進入首都郊區，美軍直昇機在建築物樓頂與航空母艦之間往返不停，將美國\n公民與少數當地領導人送到安全處。數萬名曾經支持美國政策的當地人在最後關頭都遭到拋棄，\n甚至連他們替美國提供情報的記錄都來不及銷毀。」這最可能是下列哪一場戰爭的最後場景？", "options": {"A": "越戰", "B": "韓戰", "C": "波灣戰爭", "D": "國共內戰\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 95年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 56.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 79.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 32.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 29.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 13.0, "p_value": 56.0, "p_high": 79.0, "p_low": 32.0, "discrimination": 47.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 70.0, 58.0, 43.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "1860年英法聯軍時，英國人可以輕易地雇到中國勞工為英國侵華戰爭工作；但到1884年中法戰\n爭時，香港的苦力卻拒絕幫法國的船隻裝貨。下列何者最能解釋這種現象？", "options": {"A": "1860年中國勞工為英軍工作，印證「工人無祖國」的說法", "B": "1884年時，中國勞工生活已大為改善，毋須再替外人賣命", "C": "西方列強一連串的侵略中國，激發了中國勞工的民族情感", "D": "中法戰爭波及香港，影響生計，故當地苦力不願為敵效力"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 56.0, "D": 24.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 65.0, "D": 23.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 46.0, "D": 25.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 56.0, "p_high": 65.0, "p_low": 46.0, "discrimination": 19.0, "p_quintiles": [67.0, 62.0, 56.0, 53.0, 41.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "1884年，美國芝加哥出現了世界上第一棟「摩天大樓」。此後，高聳林立的大樓逐漸改變現代\n城市的面貌，構成二十世紀都會的重要景觀。「摩天大樓」工程難度甚高，其所以能夠出現與\n下列哪一項因素最相關？", "options": {"A": "煉鋼工業的發展", "B": "混凝土的發明", "C": "玻璃帷幕的應用", "D": "建築設計能力提升"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 63.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 71.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 56.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 63.0, "p_high": 71.0, "p_low": 56.0, "discrimination": 15.0, "p_quintiles": [74.0, 66.0, 62.0, 60.0, 53.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "歷代中國百姓為了逃避徭役，常常隱匿人丁不報。但是在某一項稅制改革以後，百姓就不需要\n再隱匿人口了。這一項稅制改革應是下列何者？", "options": {"A": "北魏的均田制", "B": "中唐的兩稅法", "C": "明代的一條鞭法", "D": "清代的攤丁入畝"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 14.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 28.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 16.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 29.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 28.0}, "omit_rate": 9.0, "p_value": 28.0, "p_high": 29.0, "p_low": 28.0, "discrimination": 1.0, "p_quintiles": [29.0, 27.0, 29.0, 29.0, 28.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "一份文獻記載：這位軍事領導人抵臺不久，即召開軍事會議，並宣布：除了留下少數部隊負責\n防守外，其他的戰士都以部隊為單位，配給土地，進行開墾。這位軍事領導人應是下列何者？", "options": {"A": "施琅", "B": "鄭成功", "C": "樺山資紀", "D": "蔣介石"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 89.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 99.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 73.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 89.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 73.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 98.0, 94.0, 86.0, 65.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "一本回憶錄描述：「那一段時間，我每天接受強迫勞動、學習、寫交代、寫檢查、寫思想匯報。\n任何人都可以責罵我、教訓我、指揮我。從外地來串連的人，可以隨意點名叫我去示眾，還要\n自報罪行。這個時候，大規模的群眾性批鬥還沒有開始，但已經越來越逼近了。」這裡描寫的\n景象應是下列何者？", "options": {"A": "史達林統治時期，蘇聯異議份子受到批鬥", "B": "希特勒當政時期，德國的猶太人備受迫害", "C": "二二八事變期間，台灣菁英人士橫遭鎮壓", "D": "文化大革命期間，中國知識份子慘遭鬥爭"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 69.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 92.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 41.0}, "omit_rate": 9.0, "p_value": 69.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 41.0, "discrimination": 51.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 85.0, 73.0, 56.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "十七世紀時，荷蘭聯合東印度公司雇用著名的印刷業家族，為公司繪製航海地圖。繪圖人員受\n雇後，必須在阿姆斯特丹市長的面前起誓，答應要保守秘密，不讓航海圖上的資訊外流。聯合\n東印度公司此一作法最主要是出自何種考量？", "options": {"A": "戰爭", "B": "商業", "C": "文化", "D": "外交"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 88.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 98.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 72.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 88.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 72.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 97.0, 93.0, 86.0, 64.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "某位史家指出：中國現代史上，有一位領袖領導的政府，為中國建立了一個現代國家的上層管\n理階層；而另一位領袖領導的政權，則建立了以農村為基礎的下層社會經濟秩序。這兩位領袖\n最可能是下列何者？", "options": {"A": "洪秀全、曾國藩", "B": "孫中山、蔣介石", "C": "蔣介石、毛澤東", "D": "毛澤東、鄧小平"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 71.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 93.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 41.0, "D": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 71.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 41.0, "discrimination": 52.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 89.0, 79.0, 61.0, 31.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "威廉•瓊斯爵士（Sir William Jones）是十八世紀英國駐印度殖民地法官，受過歐洲的古典教育，\n卻迷上印度文化。他精通波斯語、梵語和近代印度語言，如孟加拉語、印地語。他為文指出：\n這些印度語言之間，還有它們跟希臘語、拉丁語與近代歐洲語言之間，都存在有密切的關係。\n我們應如何理解瓊斯爵士此一語言學「發現」？", "options": {"A": "具有歷史根據。亞歷山大東征時曾征服印度北部，將希臘語傳入印度", "B": "缺乏歷史根據。瓊斯個人因為雅好印度文化，以致產生此一文化幻想", "C": "有語言學根據。印度人源自雅利安人（Aryan），是印歐民族的一支", "D": "出自政治動機。殖民官員為拉攏印度民心，刻意製造神話，以利統治\n- 3 -\n95年指考 第 4 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 45.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 42.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 36.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 57.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 50.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 29.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 9.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 57.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 28.0, "p_quintiles": [62.0, 49.0, 39.0, 34.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-024", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 24, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "牡丹社事件發生時，日本某報刊登了一幅臺灣地\n圖，如圖。這一幅地圖應如何解讀，最為合理？", "options": {"A": "橫畫台灣地圖，顯示明治維新初期，日人地\n理知識不足", "B": "日人擅劃漢、番疆界，刻意挑動兩者矛盾，\n冀從中漁利", "C": "強調清朝主權不及於台灣東部，意圖合理化\n其侵台行動", "D": "日軍刻意披露對台軍事計畫，以爭取日人支\n持政府決策"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 75.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 95.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 28.0, "C": 49.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 49.0, "discrimination": 46.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 90.0, 81.0, 66.0, 40.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-025", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 25, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "漢武帝派遣使臣出使西域，足跡及於今阿富汗、巴基斯坦、伊朗、印度等地。幾位同學討論這\n一事件的重要歷史意義，下列何種說法最適當？", "options": {"A": "這只是一時的戰略需求，並無後續影響", "B": "漢朝因此擊潰匈奴，漢文化才得以延續", "C": "漢朝得以佔領西域，進而主導中亞貿易", "D": "中國得以認識西域情勢，開展文化交流"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 87.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 96.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 74.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 87.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 74.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 94.0, 91.0, 85.0, 68.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-026", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 26, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "唐代法律規定：「奴婢等同於家產」，同時規定解放奴婢的程序如下：由一家之主的家長給予證\n明書，但證明書須由諸子共同連署，然後送交本地官府，依據法定程序來辦理。關於這項規定，\n以下說明何者最合適？", "options": {"A": "法律程序顯示當時家長權力的獨大", "B": "諸子共同連署顯示嫡長子地位下降", "C": "法律反映財產觀念是以家庭為單位", "D": "這段資料不足以反映家長權的大小"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 65.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 78.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 50.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 65.0, "p_high": 78.0, "p_low": 50.0, "discrimination": 28.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 73.0, 67.0, 59.0, 45.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-027", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 27, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "「這一個共和生存下來了，但在議會政治的外表下，真正的主宰是專制、自主的軍官團，大的\n企業組合，與專業的文官系統。」「這些集團對政治自由並無執著精神，如果議會政權在外交\n或經濟方面失敗，他們會將其推到一邊，而喜歡比較有效率的體制。」這些評論是在說明下列\n哪一個政治現象？", "options": {"A": "1850年代，路易拿破崙獲得支持的原因", "B": "1916年時，袁世凱膽敢進行帝制的緣由", "C": "1920年代，納粹運動在德國興起的背景", "D": "1930年代，日本少壯派軍人奪權的基礎"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 36.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 37.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 35.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 29.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 20.0, "p_value": 27.0, "p_high": 35.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 14.0, "p_quintiles": [38.0, 29.0, 24.0, 23.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-028", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 28, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "清代一位官員報告：臺灣南北各廳縣生產的米穀，首先要用牛車載運至沿海港口，再用舢舨等\n小船，沿著海岸運到府城鹿耳門，才能裝載於橫洋大船，轉運至廈門。下列敘述何者最能全面\n性地解釋此種現象？", "options": {"A": "臺南不生產米穀，仰賴南北供應", "B": "臺灣島內南北向的長途陸運困難", "C": "臺灣僅鹿耳門港深足以停靠大船", "D": "臺灣的沿海航運比遠洋還要發達"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 59.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 76.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 41.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 59.0, "p_high": 76.0, "p_low": 41.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 69.0, 60.0, 50.0, 37.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-029", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 29, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "某個時代，有人主張學問要自有心得：讀孔子之書，必須與自己的經驗相印證；如果心中不以\n為然，那麼，即使是孔子之言，也不能承認就是對的。這種思想觀念傳播甚廣，知識界於是出\n現了不少特立獨行之士。這最可能是以下哪類人物的主張？", "options": {"A": "諸子百家", "B": "竹林七賢", "C": "陽明學派", "D": "五四健將\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 95年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 64.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 80.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 43.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 64.0, "p_high": 80.0, "p_low": 43.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [82.0, 76.0, 70.0, 59.0, 35.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-030", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 30, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "有一座農莊，莊內農民約定成俗，以下表顯示的方式，進行集體耕作：\n這應該是下列哪一種時空下的農莊？\n耕地甲 耕地乙 耕地丙", "options": {"A": "先秦時代的黃土高原\n第1年 裸麥或冬麥 燕麥或豌豆 休 耕", "B": "拓荒時期的美國西部", "C": "隋唐時代的關中平原 第2年 燕麥或豌豆 休 耕 裸麥或冬麥", "D": "中古時期的西歐地區 第3年 休 耕 裸麥或冬麥 燕麥或豌豆"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 63.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 89.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 35.0}, "omit_rate": 15.0, "p_value": 63.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 35.0, "discrimination": 54.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 81.0, 66.0, 49.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-031", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 31, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "過去，政府以徭役的方式徵調工匠，在官府作坊從事生產。但隨著社會經濟的改變，自某個時\n期起，政府開始從民間雇傭工匠，甚至不再經營手工業作坊，改成直接向民間購買。這裡所說\n的「某個時期」，最早可能是下列何者？", "options": {"A": "漢晉之間", "B": "唐宋之間", "C": "元明之間", "D": "明清之間"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 28.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 36.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 34.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 21.0}, "omit_rate": 16.0, "p_value": 33.0, "p_high": 36.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 7.0, "p_quintiles": [38.0, 33.0, 34.0, 32.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-032", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 32, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "一位來臺的官員觀察到：某些地方居民「將鵝毛管削尖，沾取小筒貯存的墨汁，自左而右橫向書\n寫，登記政府的文告以及稅收數量」。下列哪一種文獻的形成與這位官員看到的文化現象有關？", "options": {"A": "《巴達維亞日記》", "B": "《新港文書》", "C": "《淡新檔案》", "D": "《岸裡社文書》"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 65.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 85.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 16.0, "B": 43.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 16.0, "p_value": 65.0, "p_high": 85.0, "p_low": 43.0, "discrimination": 42.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 78.0, 66.0, 54.0, 38.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-033", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 33, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "某書描述歷史上某一勢力：「它曾是世界上首屈一指的經濟強權，經由遍佈亞洲、歐洲和非洲\n的廣大商務網及交通網，交易種類繁多的商品：從非洲進口奴隸和黃金，從歐洲進口奴隸和羊\n毛，並與亞洲文明國家交易糧食、香料和各式各樣的織品。」這個勢力最可能是下列何者？", "options": {"A": "二世紀時的羅馬帝國", "B": "十四世紀的拜占庭帝國", "C": "九世紀的阿拔斯帝國", "D": "十九世紀時的大英帝國"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 58.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 61.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 50.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 7.0, "p_high": 13.0, "p_low": 3.0, "discrimination": 10.0, "p_quintiles": [16.0, 7.0, 4.0, 3.0, 3.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-034", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 34, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "學者指出：在西周封建制度下，同姓集團授予封土，賜之以氏。當時，姓、氏是統治階級的特\n權，「貴者有氏，賤者有名無氏」。到戰國時代以後，姓氏的分野逐漸泯除，平民逐漸獲得姓氏。\n平民得姓一事與下列哪個趨勢的關係最直接？", "options": {"A": "賦役制度的變化", "B": "以孝道治天下", "C": "郡縣制度的發展", "D": "皇帝制度的形成"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 29.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 52.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 31.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 57.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 27.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 9.0, "p_value": 29.0, "p_high": 31.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 4.0, "p_quintiles": [31.0, 30.0, 29.0, 29.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-035", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 35, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "「和與戰怎能由人類來決定？這事只能取決於神的意志。神同人一般，具有需要愛情與睡眠的\n弱點。而除了飢餓與死亡外，凡是人類做的事，祂們都做，也都干涉。」下列哪一類人最可能\n持有這種觀念？", "options": {"A": "古代的希臘人", "B": "摩西時的猶太人", "C": "東征的十字軍", "D": "中古歐洲的騎士"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 60.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 80.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 40.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 60.0, "p_high": 80.0, "p_low": 40.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 70.0, 59.0, 48.0, 36.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-history-036", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 36, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "英國一家雜誌評論說：「多年以來，我們都被一個精心的陰謀所操縱，目的是建立一涵蓋全歐\n的社會主義共和國。將有一個傀儡議會、一支聯盟軍隊、一種貨幣。聯盟總統取代我們的立憲\n君主。降下大英米字旗，升上那片有黃星的藍色抹布。大家高唱〈快樂頌〉曲調，歌詞的意思\n其實是：『永別了，不列顛！』」這段文字應如何理解最為恰當？", "options": {"A": "英國的資本主義對抗蘇聯的共產主義", "B": "大英的自由民主對抗納粹的擴張主義", "C": "英國文化優越感擔心美國的霸權優勢", "D": "大英的孤立心態抗拒歐洲的統合主義"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 15.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 51.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 11.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 73.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 19.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 9.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 44.0, "p_quintiles": [79.0, 63.0, 51.0, 39.0, 23.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
